 Installs the public key that signs the brave-os package repository and the
 deb822 source entry for it (https://raw.githubusercontent.com/narainio/brave-os-apt/main, suite trixie). The appliance's
 own packages receive updates through that repository; APT verifies every
 release file against this keyring (Signed-By), never against the global
 trust store.
